# Environment variables for Potential
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is required starting Phase 5 (proxy + live AI).
# Not needed for Phase 1-4.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_key_here
# IMPORTANT: web search must also be enabled in the Anthropic Console org settings
# before the capture script or live /api/live calls will return real data.
# Without it, the proxy silently falls back to the golden-path cache (fromCache:true).
# The capture script (scripts/capture-golden-path.ts) will throw on fromCache:true,
# preventing stale data from being written to demo-results.json.
